[en.DECISION_C01_C02_RECONSTRUCTION_II]
Ponyville Security

[en.DECISION_C01_C02_RECONSTRUCTION_II_desc]
As the reconstruction plan progresses smoothly, the security issues in Ponyville and its surrounding areas have gradually become prominent - the villages to the east near the rebel forces have been occupied by thugs, gangs, and criminals, becoming a major security hazard. The Empire will take active measures to ensure the safety of Ponyville.
The same result? No, no, no, it’s much easier now - we have successfully changed their names: when the police of EEMO are dispatched not to suppress the “public”, but to suppress the “thugs, gangs, and criminals”, then everything is legal.

[en.DECISION_C01_C02_RECONSTRUCTION_II_TRIGGER_TOOLTIP]
§YPonyville Reconstruction§! Completed

[zh.DECISION_C01_C02_RECONSTRUCTION_II]
小马谷治安计划

[zh.DECISION_C01_C02_RECONSTRUCTION_II_desc]
随着重建计划的顺利推进，小马谷及其周边地区的治安问题也逐渐凸显出来——东边那些临近叛军的村庄，被流氓、黑帮和犯罪分子占据，成为了治安的重要隐患。帝国将会积极采取措施，确保小马谷的安全。
殊途同归？不不不，这一切现在都好办多了——我们已经成功将他们的名字改变了：当秩序部的警察出动不是为了镇压“民众”，而是镇压“流氓、黑帮和犯罪分子”，那么一切就都合法了。

[zh.DECISION_C01_C02_RECONSTRUCTION_II_TRIGGER_TOOLTIP]
完成 §Y小马谷重建计划§!
